Subject: Modeling Algorithms - BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer reports the contours and vertices where it failed
Upstream: not yet filed (Silico files it before carrying this patch on main, then names it here)
Applies to: OCCT V7_9_3.
Why: BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet passes on its builder's report of where a failed build failed
     (NbFaultyContours, FaultyContour, NbFaultyVertices, FaultyVertex, StripeStatus);
     BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer keeps the same report in its private ChFi3d_ChBuilder and doesn't.
     Silico reads it to name the edges of a failed chamfer, as it does a fillet's. Accessors only,
     forwarding to the builder as MakeFillet's do: no result changes. All five, as MakeFillet
     has, though Silico reads no chamfer's faulty vertices (they mislead: docs/ports/chamfer.md),
     so the class matches MakeFillet's upstream.
Drop when: Silico upgrades to an OCCT release with these accessors (or upstream's equivalent).

--- a/src/BRepFilletAPI/BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer.hxx
+++ b/src/BRepFilletAPI/BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer.hxx
@@ -296,7 +296,24 @@
 
   Standard_EXPORT Handle(ChFiDS_SecHArray1) Sect(const Standard_Integer IC,
                                                  const Standard_Integer IS) const Standard_OVERRIDE;
+
+  //! Returns the number of contours where the computation failed.
+  Standard_EXPORT Standard_Integer NbFaultyContours() const;
+
+  //! For each I in [1.. NbFaultyContours] returns the index IC of
+  //! the contour where the computation failed.
+  Standard_EXPORT Standard_Integer FaultyContour(const Standard_Integer I) const;
 
+  //! Returns the number of vertices where the computation failed.
+  Standard_EXPORT Standard_Integer NbFaultyVertices() const;
+
+  //! Returns the vertex where the computation failed.
+  Standard_EXPORT TopoDS_Vertex FaultyVertex(const Standard_Integer IV) const;
+
+  //! Returns the status of the computation of the contour IC
+  //! (see ChFiDS_ErrorStatus).
+  Standard_EXPORT ChFiDS_ErrorStatus StripeStatus(const Standard_Integer IC) const;
+
 protected:
 private:
   ChFi3d_ChBuilder    myBuilder;
--- a/src/BRepFilletAPI/BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer.cxx
+++ b/src/BRepFilletAPI/BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer.cxx
@@ -372,4 +372,39 @@
                                                           const Standard_Integer IS) const
 {
   return myBuilder.Sect(IC, IS);
+}
+
+//=================================================================================================
+
+Standard_Integer BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer::NbFaultyContours() const
+{
+  return myBuilder.NbFaultyContours();
 }
+
+//=================================================================================================
+
+Standard_Integer BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer::FaultyContour(const Standard_Integer I) const
+{
+  return myBuilder.FaultyContour(I);
+}
+
+//=================================================================================================
+
+Standard_Integer BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer::NbFaultyVertices() const
+{
+  return myBuilder.NbFaultyVertices();
+}
+
+//=================================================================================================
+
+TopoDS_Vertex BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer::FaultyVertex(const Standard_Integer IV) const
+{
+  return myBuilder.FaultyVertex(IV);
+}
+
+//=================================================================================================
+
+ChFiDS_ErrorStatus BRepFilletAPI_MakeChamfer::StripeStatus(const Standard_Integer IC) const
+{
+  return myBuilder.StripeStatus(IC);
+}
